title: task_munir_3_inactive
---
Munir: Assalamaleykum, Prince. I need your help urgently.  
Prince: Walaykum assalam. What’s the situation?  
Munir: A guest scholar is coming, and things are scattered all over.  
Munir: I need five things picked up and brought to the front hall.  
Munir: From the prayer hall – there’s a spare microphone near the minbar and a Qur’an left on the floor.  
Munir: From the entrance – some rolled-up mats need to be brought in, and the trash bin lost its lid.  
Munir: And from the gate – there’s a plastic chair for the elders. Bring that too.  
Prince: I can do that.  
Munir: Ten minutes, Prince. That’s all I’ve got before people start showing up.  
<<activateQuest "Munir/Tasks/MunirTask3">>
<<trackQuest "Munir/Tasks/MunirTask3">>
===


title: task_munir_3_active
---
Munir: You’ve got ten minutes to bring back five things.  
Prince: I remember: mic and Qur’an from inside, mats and lid from the entrance, chair from the gate.  
Munir: Exactly. Don’t forget a single one.  
===

title: task_munir_3_completed
---
Munir: You brought everything — exactly as I asked.  
Prince: All five, within the time limit.  
Munir: May Allah reward your speed and care. You’re proving yourself, Prince.  
Prince: Happy to help, Munir.  
===


title: task_munir_3_abandoned
---
Munir: None of the items were brought back. What happened?  
Prince: I didn’t get to it.  
Munir: Not every task is hard. But ignoring small things leads to big consequences.  
Prince: You’re right. I won’t leave it like that again.  
===

title: task_munir_3_failed
---
Munir: The time ran out, and we’re still missing some items.  
Prince: I didn’t move fast enough.  
Munir: There’s barakah in being early, Prince. I hope next time you’ll move with more urgency.  
Prince: I understand. I’ll make it right.  
===

